      "cml:integrityHash": "40eb06cfd914f4e042b320f0c168f4cf063e73227185333e4c5f3b1e4c38b4db",
      "skos:note": "Communication from AFP must not start passing over a telecommunications system until it is no longer under control of specified employees. A contravention is taken to be a contravention if it has been committed or is suspected on reasonable grounds of having been committed."
    },
