    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-5g-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5G(1) The intended recipient of a communication",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, the intended recipient of a\ncommunication is:\n\n(a) if the communication is addressed to an individual (either in\nthe individual’s own capacity or in the capacity of an\nemployee or agent of another person)—the individual; or\n\n(b) if the communication is addressed to a person who is not an\nindividual—the person; or\n\n(c) if the communication is not addressed to a person—the\nperson who has, or whose employee or agent has, control\nover the telecommunications service to which the\ncommunication is sent."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-5g-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
