    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-5g-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5G(2) The intended recipient of a communication",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-5g-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In addition to the person who is the intended recipient of a\ncommunication under subsection (1), if a communication is\naddressed to a person at an address on a computer network\noperated by or on behalf of the Australian Federal Police, each of\nthe following is also an intended recipient of the communication\nfor the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) any AFP employee responsible for operating, protecting and\nmaintaining the network;\n\n(b) any AFP employee responsible for enforcement of the\nprofessional standards of the Australian Federal Police.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In addition to the person who is the intended recipient of a\ncommunication under subsection (1), if a communication is\naddressed to a person at an address on a computer network\noperated by or on behalf of the Australian Federal Police, each of\nthe following is also an intended recipient of the communication\nfor the purposes of this Act:\n\n(a) any AFP employee responsible for operating, protecting and\nmaintaining the network;\n\n(b) any AFP employee responsible for enforcement of the\nprofessional standards of the Australian Federal Police.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-5g"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
