      "cml:premiseText": "(a) has been received by the telecommunications service provided to the intended recipient; or (b) is under the control of the intended recipient; or (c) has been delivered to the telecommunications service provided to the intended recipient.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The communication is accessible to its intended recipient during receipt, control, or delivery."
    },
