      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 After subsection 9(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\nStored communications  Schedule 1\nPrincipal amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006                   9\n\n(1A) The reference in paragraph (1)(b) to the interception of\ncommunications made to or from a telecommunications service\nincludes a reference to the accessing of the communications as\nstored communications after they have ceased to pass over a\ntelecommunications system."
