      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1A) The reference in subparagraph (1)(d)(ii) to the interception not\ncommencing includes a reference to the communications, that were\nto be intercepted, not being accessed as stored communications\nafter they have ceased to pass over a telecommunications system.",
