      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(b), access to a stored\ncommunication is taken to be under an interception warrant if, and\nonly if, the warrant would have authorised interception of the\ncommunication if it were still passing over a telecommunications\nsystem.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of paragraph (2)(b), access to a stored\ncommunication is taken to be under an interception warrant if, and\nonly if, the warrant would have authorised interception of the\ncommunication if it were still passing over a telecommunications\nsystem.",
