      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The chief officer of an enforcement agency may, in writing,\nauthorise persons (including classes of persons) for the purposes of\nsubsection (2). However, each person must be entitled under\nsection 110 to make applications on the agency’s behalf."
    },
