      "values:originalText": "(1) A stored communications warrant:\n\n(a) must be in accordance with the prescribed form; and\n\n(b) must be signed by the issuing authority who issues it.\n\n(2) A stored communications warrant may specify conditions or\nrestrictions relating to accessing stored communications under the\nwarrant.\n\n(3) A stored communications warrant must set out short particulars of\neach serious contravention in relation to which the issuing\nauthority issuing the warrant was satisfied, on the application for\nthe warrant, as mentioned in paragraph 116(1)(d)."
