      "skos:definition": "(1) The authority conferred by a stored communications warrant must\nnot be exercised by a person who is not an officer or staff member\nof an enforcement agency in relation to whom an approval under\nsubsection (2) is in force in relation to the warrant.\n\nStored communications  Schedule 1\nPrincipal amendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006                   21",
