      "values:originalText": "(1) A person commits an offence if the person obstructs or hinders\nanother person acting under a stored communications warrant.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 6 months or 30 penalty units, or both.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person commits an offence if the person obstructs or hinders\nanother person acting under a stored communications warrant.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 6 months or 30 penalty units, or both.",
      "values:partOf": {
