      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person obstructing or hindering\nhas a reasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person obstructing or hindering\nhas a reasonable excuse.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).",
      "values:partOf": {
