      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-3-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Forbids offences punishable by fine for at least 60 penalty units",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(ii) if the offence is committed by an individual—by a fine, or a maximum fine, of at least 60 penalty units;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...or to pay an amount that is the monetary equivalent of 60 penalty units or more."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-3-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Forbids offences punishable by fine for at least 300 penalty units",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(iii) if the offence cannot be committed by an individual—by a fine, or a maximum fine, of at least 300 penalty units;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...or to pay a pecuniary penalty of 300 penalty units or more."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-3-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Forbids rendering person liable for pecuniary penalty",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) could, if established, render the person committing the contravention liable:",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...to pay a pecuniary penalty of 60 penalty units or more, or to pay an amount that is the monetary equivalent of 60 penalty units or more."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-3-logic-deontic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Forbids rendering person liable for pecuniary penalty (300 units)",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) could, if established, render the person committing the contravention liable:",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...to pay a pecuniary penalty of 300 penalty units or more, or to pay an amount that is the monetary equivalent of 300 penalty units or more."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "28(4) Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-28-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A proceeding to which this subsection applies is:\n\n(a) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for an offence of a kind\nreferred to in paragraph (3)(a) or (b); or\n\n(b) a proceeding for the confiscation or forfeiture of property, or\nfor the imposition of a pecuniary penalty, in connection with\nthe commission of such an offence; or\n\n(c) a proceeding for the taking of evidence pursuant to section 43\nof the Extradition Act 1988, in so far as the proceeding\nrelates to such an offence; or\n\n(d) a proceeding for the extradition of a person from a State or a\nTerritory to another State or Territory, in so far as the\nproceeding relates to such an offence; or\n\n(e) a proceeding for recovery of a pecuniary penalty for a\ncontravention of a kind referred to in paragraph (3)(c).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A proceeding to which this subsection applies is:\n\n(a) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for an offence of a kind\nreferred to in paragraph (3)(a) or (b); or\n\n(b) a proceeding for the confiscation or forfeiture of property, or\nfor the imposition of a pecuniary penalty, in connection with\nthe commission of such an offence; or\n\n(c) a proceeding for the taking of evidence pursuant to section 43\nof the Extradition Act 1988, in so far as the proceeding\nrelates to such an offence; or\n\n(d) a proceeding for the extradition of a person from a State or a\nTerritory to another State or Territory, in so far as the\nproceeding relates to such an offence; or\n\n(e) a proceeding for recovery of a pecuniary penalty for a\ncontravention of a kind referred to in paragraph (3)(c).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "41a737c4ecb5b31486203127d87ec493b4a4c93d2ccd38ad83fde62d14c21902",
      "skos:note": "Exempts proceedings from certain types of prosecution or confiscation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-28-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "28(4) Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 32,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A proceeding to which this subsection applies is:\n\n(a) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for an offence of a kind\nreferred to in paragraph (3)(a) or (b); or\n\n(b) a proceeding for the confiscation or forfeiture of property, or\nfor the imposition of a pecuniary penalty, in connection with\nthe commission of such an offence; or\n\n(c) a proceeding for the taking of evidence pursuant to section 43\nof the Extradition Act 1988, in so far as the proceeding\nrelates to such an offence; or\n\n(d) a proceeding for the extradition of a person from a State or a\nTerritory to another State or Territory, in so far as the\nproceeding relates to such an offence; or\n\n(e) a proceeding for recovery of a pecuniary penalty for a\ncontravention of a kind referred to in paragraph (3)(c)."
    },
