    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "28(5) Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-28-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, a reference in subsection (3) to a number of\npenalty units in relation to a contravention of a law of a State or a\nTerritory includes a reference to an amount of a fine or pecuniary\npenalty that is equivalent, under section 4AA of the Crimes Act\n1914, to that number of penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) To avoid doubt, a reference in subsection (3) to a number of\npenalty units in relation to a contravention of a law of a State or a\nTerritory includes a reference to an amount of a fine or pecuniary\npenalty that is equivalent, under section 4AA of the Crimes Act\n1914, to that number of penalty units.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-28-ss-5-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "29c6755ec1e5c116733466527a6c5c1fd8ba1651101283802ff07e2c543dac46",
      "skos:note": "Defines penalty units in relation to contravention of a law."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-28-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "28(5) Telecommunications (Interception) Amendment Act 2006",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 32,
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, a reference in subsection (3) to a number of\npenalty units in relation to a contravention of a law of a State or a\nTerritory includes a reference to an amount of a fine or pecuniary\npenalty that is equivalent, under section 4AA of the Crimes Act\n1914, to that number of penalty units."
    },
