      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "A person who is permitted by section 135, 137 or 138 or\nsubsection 140(1) to communicate particular information to\nanother person may:\n\n(a) make a record of the information, or\n\n(b) cause such a record to be made;\nfor the purpose of so communicating the information in accordance\nwith that section or subsection.",
      "skos:definition": "A person who is permitted by section 135, 137 or 138 or\nsubsection 140(1) to communicate particular information to\nanother person may:\n\n(a) make a record of the information, or\n\n(b) cause such a record to be made;\nfor the purpose of so communicating the information in accordance\nwith that section or subsection.",
