      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Each report under subsection (1) in relation to a financial year must\nbe given to the Minister as soon as practicable after the end of the\nfinancial year, and in any event within 3 months after the end of\nthe financial year.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Each report under subsection (1) in relation to a financial year must\nbe given to the Minister as soon as practicable after the end of the\nfinancial year, and in any event within 3 months after the end of\nthe financial year.",
