    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-154",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "154 Ombudsman’s general powers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-154"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to section 133, the Ombudsman’s powers under the\nOmbudsman Act 1976 extend to an inspection by the Ombudsman\nunder this Division as if the inspection were an investigation by the\nOmbudsman under that Act.\n\n(2) The exercise of those powers in relation to an inspection by the\nOmbudsman under this Division is taken, for all purposes, to be an\nexercise of powers under the Ombudsman Act 1976.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to section 133, the Ombudsman’s powers under the\nOmbudsman Act 1976 extend to an inspection by the Ombudsman\nunder this Division as if the inspection were an investigation by the\nOmbudsman under that Act.\n\n(2) The exercise of those powers in relation to an inspection by the\nOmbudsman under this Division is taken, for all purposes, to be an\nexercise of powers under the Ombudsman Act 1976.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-154-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-154-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1882aee30efcf13a7be14861341c1754bec338fd6177c018dbc93ff96d123dc6"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-154",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "154 Ombudsman’s general powers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 39,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to section 133, the Ombudsman’s powers under the\nOmbudsman Act 1976 extend to an inspection by the Ombudsman\nunder this Division as if the inspection were an investigation by the\nOmbudsman under that Act.\n\n(2) The exercise of those powers in relation to an inspection by the\nOmbudsman under this Division is taken, for all purposes, to be an\nexercise of powers under the Ombudsman Act 1976."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-154-ss-1",
