    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-162",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "162 Report to set out how many applications made and warrants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-162"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.43",
      "values:originalText": "issued\n\n(1) The report must set out, for each enforcement agency:\n\n(a) the relevant statistics about applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that the agency made during that\nyear; and\n\n(b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that the agency made during that\nyear.\n\n(2) The report must set out:\n\n(a) the relevant statistics about applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that were made during that year;\nand\n\n(b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that were made during that year;\nand\n\n(c) the relevant statistics about renewal applications made during\nthat year; and\n\n(d) how many stored communications warrants issued on\napplications made during that year specified conditions or\nrestrictions relating to access to stored communications under\nthe warrants.",
      "skos:definition": "issued\n\n(1) The report must set out, for each enforcement agency:\n\n(a) the relevant statistics about applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that the agency made during that\nyear; and\n\n(b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that the agency made during that\nyear.\n\n(2) The report must set out:\n\n(a) the relevant statistics about applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that were made during that year;\nand\n\n(b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that were made during that year;\nand\n\n(c) the relevant statistics about renewal applications made during\nthat year; and\n\n(d) how many stored communications warrants issued on\napplications made during that year specified conditions or\nrestrictions relating to access to stored communications under\nthe warrants.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-162-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-162-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c91a3cc769f870fddc83082ba1274ed09441626dfe257c2c434684373a72e4ad"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-1-sec-162",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "162 Report to set out how many applications made and warrants",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 43,
      "values:originalText": "issued\n\n(1) The report must set out, for each enforcement agency:\n\n(a) the relevant statistics about applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that the agency made during that\nyear; and\n\n(b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that the agency made during that\nyear.\n\n(2) The report must set out:\n\n(a) the relevant statistics about applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that were made during that year;\nand\n\n(b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for stored\ncommunications warrants that were made during that year;\nand\n\n(c) the relevant statistics about renewal applications made during\nthat year; and\n\n(d) how many stored communications warrants issued on\napplications made during that year specified conditions or\nrestrictions relating to access to stored communications under\nthe warrants."
    },
