      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.43",
      "values:originalText": "The report must set out, for each enforcement agency:\n\n(a) how many arrests were made during that year on the basis of\ninformation that was, or included, lawfully accessed\ninformation; and\n\nSchedule 1  Stored communications",
      "skos:definition": "The report must set out, for each enforcement agency:\n\n(a) how many arrests were made during that year on the basis of\ninformation that was, or included, lawfully accessed\ninformation; and\n\nSchedule 1  Stored communications",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006-sch-1-sec-163-norm"
        },
