      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "167(2) No limitation on other liability",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(2) An application under subsection 165(3) or (4) may be made even if\nthe defendant referred to in that subsection has been convicted of\nan offence under, or arising out of, this Act."
    },
