      "cof:title": "32 Subsection 5(1) (at the end of the definition of certifying",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "officer)\nAdd:\n\n; or (j) in the case of any other agency:\n\n(i) the chief executive officer or an acting chief executive\nofficer of the agency; or\n\n(ii) an officer of the agency (by whatever name called) who\nholds, or is acting in, an office or position in the agency\nwhich is involved in the management of the agency and\nwhich has been nominated in writing by the chief\nexecutive officer for the purposes of this subparagraph.\n\nSchedule 1  Stored communications"
    },
