      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nNote:\nSubparagraph (a)(ia)—subsection (3) restricts the issuing of warrants\nif subparagraph (a)(ia) applies.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nNote:\nSubparagraph (a)(ia)—subsection (3) restricts the issuing of warrants\nif subparagraph (a)(ia) applies.",
