      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 77,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(d) information that would be likely to be obtained by\nintercepting under a warrant:\n\n(i) communications made to or from any\ntelecommunications service that the person is using, or\nis likely to use; or\n\n(ii) communications made by means of a particular\ntelecommunications device that a person is using, or is\nlikely to use;\n\nSchedule 3  Equipment-based interception"
    },
