      "skos:note": "Omit certain references to the Chief Executive Officer of the ACC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-amendment-act-2006#sch-5-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Subsection 5(1) (subparagraph (a)(v) of the definition of",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 86,
      "values:originalText": "permitted purpose)\nOmit “the Chief Executive Officer of the ACC by subsections 80(2),\n81(2) and 81(3)”, substitute “the chief officer of a Commonwealth\nagency by sections 80 and 81”."
    },
    {
